.TH CRUNCH_QUERY_MODULE 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_query_module \- invokes obsolete query_module syscall 178, unimplemented on linux x86-64 and returning enosys
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/module.h>
.B int crunch_query_module(const char* name, int which, void* buffer, size_t size, size_t* result);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes obsolete query_module syscall 178, unimplemented on Linux x86-64 and returning ENOSYS.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR query_module (2)
